    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "在图13.3-1（1）中，将 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "和 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "剪下，分别拼在 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle A"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的左右，三个角合起来形成一个平角，出现一条过点A的直线l，移动后的 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "和"
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "各有一条边在直线上．想一想，直线与 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的边BC有什么关系?你能由这个图想出证明“三角形的内角和等于 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "1 8 0 ^ { \\circ , \\mathfrak { s } }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的方法吗?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        122,
